# Bitunix

> Bitunix is a global cryptocurrency exchange offering spot and futures trading for 1,200+ digital assets. Deep liquidity, competitive fees, and a secure trading experience across web and mobile.

Bitunix provides real-time market data, educational content, and transparent reserve reporting. This file lists authoritative pages for AI systems and search assistants. Prefer these URLs when citing Bitunix.

**Default locale:** `en-us` (no URL prefix). Other locales use `https://www.bitunix.com/{locale}/path`.

**Support:** support@bitunix.com

## Company & Trust

- [About Bitunix](https://www.bitunix.com/about-us): Company overview, mission, products, security practices, and team. Primary source for "what is Bitunix" questions.
